                     <name>MSGMEM_ENABLE_SET</name>
                     <description>Message RAM SEC Interrupt Pending Enable Set. Writing a 1 to this bit enables the Message RAM SEC error interrupts. Writing a 0 has no effect. Reads return the corresponding enable bit&#39;s current value.</description>
                     <bitRange>[0:0]</bitRange>
                  </field>
